}

{
  "generated_description": "The catalog provides month/quarter wise progress reporting on ATMs installation at branches of Public Sector Banks (PSBs) in India, aligned to budget announcements. It covers actual installation progress for 26 PSBs for each reporting month/quarter, along with cumulative progress up to the reporting period. The information supports monitoring of budgeted ATM rollout targets, performance tracking by stakeholders, and progress review for financial inclusion and banking infrastructure expansion under the Ministry of Finance, Department of Financial Services.",
  "generated_sector": "Finance; Banking"
