{
  "generated_description": "Month and Year-wise Average of International Crude Oil Prices (Indian Basket) provides time series averages of international crude oil prices for the Indian Basket. Published by the Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Gas, it supports monitoring of petroleum market performance and helps inform planning and analysis related to petroleum supply, refining economics, and energy procurement. The coverage is for India and is organized by month and year, enabling trend assessment across successive periods.",
