{
  "generated_description": "The catalog covers month-wise quantities of fortified rice distributed under the pilot scheme. It supports monitoring and evaluation of rice fortification efforts by tracking distribution volumes over time. The data pertains to the pilot rollout across 11 states, with one district per state, enabling state-level program review and supply planning. Published by the Ministry of Consumer Affairs, Food and Public Distribution; Department of Food and Public Distribution, it is useful for policymakers, program managers, and researchers studying food fortification and public distribution.",
